Flowchart Legend & Diagnostic Breakdown

• Physical Connection Faults (COM List Empty): PySerial cannot see the hardware hardware profile. 90% of these cases are caused by a loose USB cable or an unpowered controller board. Always check that the red power indicator on the board is illuminated.
• Telemetry Baud Mismatch (Frozen Graph): If the connection succeeds but the chart displays flat lines at zero, data packages are arriving garbled. The Arduino code and Python driver must match at exactly 115200 Baud.
• Windows Directory Security (Save Failures): Windows protects its root drives (C:\Program Files\). If the executable is copied here, it will be blocked from creating the test results subfolder. Always execute the application from a user workspace like C:\Users\Admin\Documents\COMPRESSION.
